<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n101278" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συρμός</span></b> , ὁ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">σύρω</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>any sweeping motion</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γινέσθω
				μὴ κατὰ πληγὴν ἡ ἐγχάραξις, ἀλλὰ κατὰ ς</span>. <i><span class="en">
				Antyll.
			</span></i> ap. <i><span class="en">
				Orib.
				7.18.6
			</span></i>; <i>track</i> of meteors, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρηστήρων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Pl.
					<u>Ax.</u>
					370c
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Mir.</u>
				843a11
			</span></i>; <i>sweep</i> of waves, <i><span class="en">
				Ph.
				1.298
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">νιφετῶν, ἀνέμων</span>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>AP</u>
				7.8
			</span></i> (Antip. Sid., pl.), <i><span class="en">
				498
			</span></i> (Antip.); <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χαλαζήεις</span> ib.<i><span class="en">
				6.221
			</span></i> (<i><span class="en">
				Leon.
			</span></i>); <i>trail</i> of a serpent, <i><span class="en">
				Plu.
				<u>Ant.</u>
				86
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>vomiting</i> or <i>purging</i> (cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">συρμαία</span>), <i><span class="en">
				Nic.
				<u>Al.</u>
				256
			</span></i>.</div>
